{"c":[{"name":"20261007T015102Z-70f8faec6a3a0648","text":"R1's slow-eval runner never settles on live Jev: each pass sends 43-81 new requests, so a set costs about 3x one pass. Run live sets once.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T015102Z-cf129cc10068e635","text":"HOIST_SHARED_OPTIONS changes Jev's answers: with it on, Jev answered 'none' on names and emails on four small forms. Keep it false (LV1 compare-hoist.txt).","type":"note"}]}
